     5764                        excel-sum (f-rez-cost-pr)         CHR(9)
     5765                        chr(10) .
     5766                        run display-prt-t in this-procedure  .
     5767                End.
     5768                 accumulate f-qnty           (TOTAL ) .
     5769                 accumulate f-cost-sum       (TOTAL ) .
